msgid "Contributing {#contributing}"
msgstr "Contribuire {#contributing}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The source code is available [on GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation).\n"
msgstr "Il codice sorgente è disponibile [su GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The developer guide is located at [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) in the root of this project’s repository. By participating, you are expected to uphold Qiskit’s [code of conduct](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).\n"
msgstr "La guida per sviluppatori si trova in [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) nella radice del repository di questo progetto. Partecipando, ci si aspetta che tu rispetti il [codice di condotta](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md) di Qiskit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We use [GitHub issues](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/issues/new/choose) for tracking requests and bugs.\n"
msgstr "Usiamo le [issue di GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/issues/new/choose) per tenere traccia di richieste e bug.\n"

